<</dialog>>

I went back upstairs. The freckles followed me   not literally, but in my mind, the image of them, copper constellations on warm skin. I wanted to count them, which was a stupid thing to want on the afternoon before a goblin raid, but brains do stupid things when the rest of you is trying not to think about mortality.
